confirm_partial.description:
Elk E27 couldn't finish upgrading from the older version (0.1), and nothing was changed. Entities left over from an earlier version (for example a 0.2.0 trial) block the upgrade. Leftover entities this can delete ({count}):{entities}

Listed entities this Elk E27 entry doesn't own, so this can't delete them ({kept_count}):{kept}

Remove those by hand under Settings → Devices & services → Entities, or, if another loaded Elk E27 entry provides them, delete or disable that entry under Settings → Devices & services.

Select **Submit** to delete the entities this can delete and retry the upgrade. This removes their history link, so take a backup first. To keep any of them, close this and delete or rename them yourself under Settings → Devices & services → Entities.

